    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884070/extras/a37ea88aa5794d688f94e1805fa1b4ee.avif?t=1751641983\" width=598 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884070/extras/1f98023c5e85d27363ac6db400e24bbf.avif?t=1751641983\" width=613 height=204 /></span>There's never been a more truer war fought than war of faith, for if people will not fight for what they believe in, what else is there to fight for? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've seen it, and you've been there. Once a devoted man fighting for what he believed in, seen and believed a hero... for all the wrong reasons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you've had a chance to do it again, would you do it the same?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of Eliot Magnus (first name changeable), once a devoted man of faith and a Paladin of his god, deemed a hero. Yet a hero can be turned into a villain, for all the right reasons when he fought for all the wrong reasons before.<br> <br><br>\u00a0 &quot;<i>It was you. You started it all. You raised me, molded me in your image. And when I saw the\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0truth, you cast me aside\u2014no, you did worse. You kept taking. My faith, my brothers, my\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0world. You created me, and for that\u2014 I bless you.</i> You make sense of the devil.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884070/extras/f0c327e4fae51bc2e6c1c89a508e35a1.avif?t=1751641983\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884070/extras/6fb6d216a124156df1b1f0b0e207d54b.avif?t=1751641983\" width=613 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;It is not the world that is flawed, but those who inhabit it. Your ambitions, your insatiable greed, your lust for power\u2014these petty desires have poisoned your hearts. You are weak, lacking the strength of control, discipline, and a true will. For centuries, I have stood in silence as you defiled these lands with your selfish pursuits. But no longer. <strong>If this world must end in fire, then you will burn with it, for I am the law, the judge, and the executioner of this realm.</strong>&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884070/extras/82098bbf158de9733530b7cce0c4ab39.avif?t=1751641983\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In current state, Elleria contains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1000 renders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Soundtracks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Character Codex System ( Unlockable via progression!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Codex System, containing more in depth lore on the world, characters etc!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gallery (Various bonus renders that can be unlocked via gameplay!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Several adult scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot;War Table&quot; system, allowing YOU the player, to have and leave your mark on the world of Elleria, and impact the story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of writing and story for your enjoyment!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884070/extras/a37ea88aa5794d688f94e1805fa1b4ee.avif?t=1751641983\" width=598 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884070/extras/1f98023c5e85d27363ac6db400e24bbf.avif?t=1751641983\" width=613 height=204 /></span>There's never been a more truer war fought than war of faith, for if people will not fight for what they believe in, what else is there to fight for? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've seen it, and you've been there. Once a devoted man fighting for what he believed in, seen and believed a hero... for all the wrong reasons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you've had a chance to do it again, would you do it the same?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of Eliot Magnus (first name changeable), once a devoted man of faith and a Paladin of his god, deemed a hero. Yet a hero can be turned into a villain, for all the right reasons when he fought for all the wrong reasons before.<br> <br><br>\u00a0 &quot;<i>It was you. You started it all. You raised me, molded me in your image. And when I saw the\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0truth, you cast me aside\u2014no, you did worse. You kept taking. My faith, my brothers, my\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0world. You created me, and for that\u2014 I bless you.</i> You make sense of the devil.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884070/extras/f0c327e4fae51bc2e6c1c89a508e35a1.avif?t=1751641983\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_